                                                "sense_id": "7bde39a7-2617-39e1-9808-98280289bf80",
                                                "text": "Such portentous appetites had Queequeg and Tashtego, that to fill out the vacancies made by the previous repast, often the pale Dough-Boy was fain to bring on a great baron of salt-junk, seemingly quarried out of the solid ox."
